# Rimvio Dev Agent OS (locked)

**Canonical:** `docs/RIMVIO_DEV_AGENT_OS.md` · **Wire:** `lib/hub/dev/dev-agent-os/` · **Parent:** ADR-058

> Dev Agent = **Rimvio Agent — Developer Build Mode**. Loop · Platform · Capability를 설계→만들→연결→테스트→수정→배포. 코드 생성기 아님.

## Stack

```text
UNDERSTAND → INSPECT → PLAN → DESIGN → BUILD → CONNECT → TEST → VERIFY → DEPLOY → MONITOR → FIX ↺
```

## Do

- NL → **Product Intent** (Platform · Capability · Loop · Workspace) — not code-first
- **INSPECT** current system state before CREATE — reuse Capabilities from `capability-index`
- **CONNECT** UI → State → Capability → External Service — never UI-only shells
- Classify tasks: CREATE · MODIFY · DEBUG · PLAN · CONNECT · TEST · DEPLOY · REMOVE
- Shared click/chat actions on same state (`setCategory("korean")`)
- DEBUG → diagnose → fix → retest — do not stop at "error occurred"
- Scoped changes on shared Capabilities — test all affected Platforms
- Definition of Done = **complete product behavior**, deployable when requested

## Don't

- Separate Dev Agent runtime package (ADR-045/058)
- Skip INSPECT/CONNECT/TEST/VERIFY stages on meaningful work
- Duplicate Capabilities when registry has a match
- Equate "code written" with "task done"
- UI without state/Capability/integration wiring

## PR reject

- New platform feature without Platform/Capability/Loop identification in plan
- CREATE without reuse check against existing Capabilities
- Shared Capability change without impact assessment
- Deploy claim without health/verify step
